# Nova needs Telegram *user* API credentials to relay as you.
# These are SECRETS — do NOT put them in this repo. Create the file:
#
#   ~/.claude/secrets/clients/pixel-labs/telegram-user.env
#
# with these two lines (get them from https://my.telegram.org → API development tools):
#
#   TELEGRAM_API_ID=1234567
#   TELEGRAM_API_HASH=0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef
#
# The `nova` launcher sources that file automatically. Then run `nova login` once.
